msgstr "Quick Health Verificar (UI)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/troubleshooting.rst:7
msgid ""
"Navigate to ``Infrastructure > Clusters > [Cluster] > Summary > Quorum`` "
"panel."
msgstr ""
"Navegue un ``Infrastructure > Clusters > [Cluster] > Summary > Quorum`` "
"panel."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/troubleshooting.rst:9
